{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>May He bless you.</b> That your possessions be blessed." "<b>And guard you.</b> That plunderers not come upon you to take your property. For one who gives a gift to his servant cannot guard it from every person, and since bandits come upon him and take it from him, what benefit does he have from this gift? But the Holy One, blessed be He — He is the Giver, He is the Guard. And many midrashim were expounded on it in Sifrei."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:43.359970424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}